Package: hodohangenki
Title: News Headline Half-Life Observatory (hodo-hangenki)
Version: 0.0.1
Description: Snapshots news RSS feeds on a cron schedule and applies
    Kaplan-Meier survival analysis to headline lifetimes, publishing
    category half-lives as a static site. Built with R; deployed to
    Vercel as static files. Built with build/, not R CMD build.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    xml2,
    dplyr,
    readr,
    ggplot2,
    glue,
    svglite,
    digest
Suggests:
    testthat,
    survival
